Package: uk.551.audiorecorder-import-fix
Name: AudioRecorder Import Fix
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: 551UK
Section: Tweaks
Depends: net.limneos.audiorecorderxs-rootless (= 5.0-62), ldid, coreutils
Description: Repairs the rootless handler path in AudioRecorder's import extension.
 Corrects the action extension loader path, signs with existing entitlements,
 and restores the original executable on removal. For AudioRecorder XS 5.0-62.
